{"5137350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Motor Sport Unbounded", "steam_appid": 5137350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the World of Street Racing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Motor Sport Unbounded is an open-world arcade racing game that captures the spirit of classic street racers from the early 2000s while combining them with modern visuals and smooth, accessible gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sprawling nighttime city, discover new races, unlock cars, customize and upgrade them, and climb your way to the top of the Street Crown leaderboard.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/extras/1fcfaa382590ad12ffca2c35ec943f10.poster.avif?t=1787751329\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/extras/1fcfaa382590ad12ffca2c35ec943f10.webm?t=1787751329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/extras/1fcfaa382590ad12ffca2c35ec943f10.mp4?t=1787751329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large open-world nighttime city to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven career featuring comic-style cutscenes and SMS conversations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Street Crown ranking system with 15 unique bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of race types:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circuit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed Trap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Trial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elimination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highway Battle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and many more.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/extras/164d13241db841ec272460d1f0f253d2.poster.avif?t=1787751329\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/extras/164d13241db841ec272460d1f0f253d2.webm?t=1787751329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/extras/164d13241db841ec272460d1f0f253d2.mp4?t=1787751329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade driving physics inspired by the golden era of street racing games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep visual vehicle customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your engine, transmission, suspension, and brakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple vehicle classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic messaging system that drives the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant nighttime city filled with neon lights and atmosphere.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/extras/48a78b20902a9f2dbccea83739b157b1.poster.avif?t=1787751329\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/extras/48a78b20902a9f2dbccea83739b157b1.webm?t=1787751329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/extras/48a78b20902a9f2dbccea83739b157b1.mp4?t=1787751329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become Number One</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every victory brings you one step closer to the top of the Street Crown leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the road to the top is filled with more than just fast rivals. Betrayal, loss, risk, and revenge await those determined to reclaim what was taken from them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat all 15 bosses, reclaim your car, and prove that you deserve to become the new king of Street Crown.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the World of Street Racing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Motor Sport Unbounded is an open-world arcade racing game that captures the spirit of classic street racers from the early 2000s while combining them with modern visuals and smooth, accessible gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sprawling nighttime city, discover new races, unlock cars, customize and upgrade them, and climb your way to the top of the Street Crown leaderboard.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/extras/1fcfaa382590ad12ffca2c35ec943f10.poster.avif?t=1787751329\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/extras/1fcfaa382590ad12ffca2c35ec943f10.webm?t=1787751329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/extras/1fcfaa382590ad12ffca2c35ec943f10.mp4?t=1787751329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large open-world nighttime city to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven career featuring comic-style cutscenes and SMS conversations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Street Crown ranking system with 15 unique bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of race types:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circuit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed Trap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Trial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elimination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highway Battle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and many more.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/extras/164d13241db841ec272460d1f0f253d2.poster.avif?t=1787751329\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/extras/164d13241db841ec272460d1f0f253d2.webm?t=1787751329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/extras/164d13241db841ec272460d1f0f253d2.mp4?t=1787751329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade driving physics inspired by the golden era of street racing games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep visual vehicle customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your engine, transmission, suspension, and brakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple vehicle classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic messaging system that drives the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant nighttime city filled with neon lights and atmosphere.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/extras/48a78b20902a9f2dbccea83739b157b1.poster.avif?t=1787751329\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/extras/48a78b20902a9f2dbccea83739b157b1.webm?t=1787751329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/extras/48a78b20902a9f2dbccea83739b157b1.mp4?t=1787751329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become Number One</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every victory brings you one step closer to the top of the Street Crown leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the road to the top is filled with more than just fast rivals. Betrayal, loss, risk, and revenge await those determined to reclaim what was taken from them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat all 15 bosses, reclaim your car, and prove that you deserve to become the new king of Street Crown.</p>", "short_description": "Motor Sport Unbounded is an open-world arcade racing game inspired by the legendary street racers of the early 2000s. Explore a vast nighttime city, compete in a variety of events, upgrade your cars, challenge the Street Crown bosses, and reclaim your place at the top after a devastating betrayal.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Japanese, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/c790babee1d8b27cf244722485ec9fdd4ebd4ba8/header.jpg?t=1787751329", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/a2bece3bd482e7bbbe3dc92226853dedf8240348/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787751329", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5137350/a2bece3bd482e7bbbe3dc92226853dedf8240348/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787751329", "website": "https://linktr.ee/Sevenwolf", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum